      "widgets_values": [
        "Produce a precise four-view character turnaround on white using image 1 as a STRICT pose and layout template. Keep exactly four full figures on a single horizontal row, one per slot with empty gutters, identical height, feet and head fully inside each slot. Left to right: front facing the viewer, exact side profile nose pointing LEFT, opposite side profile nose pointing RIGHT, back of head facing the viewer. Keep those exact camera rotations. Clean and illustrate the same outfit. All four show the same girl, same hair length, body proportions, identical clothes. Ash gray-brown hair with long face-framing bangs, pale olive eyes. Wear cream graphic T-shirt over long plum sleeves, charcoal headphones around neck, burgundy plaid shirt tied at the waist, asymmetrical white lace layer over blue wide-leg cropped jeans, white high-top sneakers; half-up wavy hair exactly as in the original video. Match original references. Clean anime game character reference illustration, even studio lighting, no labels, characters only.",
